      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1713113937481,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1) iterate over each PROGRAM (outer loop)\n2) in each PROGRAM, iterate over arrayListStud and place\nthe students in their proper order according to year and ID.\n3) each addition, incremenet studCtr",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) iterate over each PROGRAM (outer loop)\n2) in each PROGRAM, iterate over arrayListStud and place\nthe students in their proper order according to year and ID.\n3) each addition, incremenet studCtr",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
